  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Trumpet pitch changed by:\n\n- A) Valves (and embouchure)\n- B) Frets\n- C) Keys like clarinet\n- D) Bowing\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Trombone uses a slide not valves.\n\n**Answer:** True\n\n### Q3. B♭ trumpet is a transposing instrument.\n\n**Answer:** True — Written C sounds concert B♭.",
